rly $80,000 as well as chemicals and printing machines used to replace old dates and nutritional information on PepsiCo, Nestle, Coca-Cola and Unilever products to make them suitable for export. The companies have not been accused of any wrongdoing, and the investigation is focusing on rogue exporters.The Canadian agency “is monitoring the situation to determine whether it presents any risk to imports into Canada. At this time, the CFIA has no information indicating that products associated with this operation entered Canada,” it said in a statement toReuters.India busts firm faking expiry dates, nutrition labels on PepsiCo, Nestle food exports“The Canadian Food ...", "published_at": "2026-09-03T11:48:42+00:00", "image_url": "https://i.brecorder.com/large/2026/09/0316475955c3c0a.webp", "source": {"name": "Business Recorder", "tier": "international", "url": "https://www.brecorder.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 16, "opinion_fact": 13, "factual_rigor": 58, "framing": 33, "confidence": 0.68, "rationale": {"lean": {"keyword_score": 50.0, "framing_shift": 0.0, "entity_shift": 0.0, "sentence_direction": 0.0, "text_score": 50.0, "source_baseline": 50, "text_shift": 0.0, "delta_max": 24, "confidence": 1.0, "top_left_keywords": [], "top_right_keywords": [], "framing_phrases_found": [], "entity_sentiments": {}, "state_affiliated": false, "unscored": true}, "sensationalism": {"headline_score": 5.0, "body_score": 9.3, "clickbait_signals": 0, "superlative_density": 0.15, "urgency_density": 0.15, "hyperbole_density": 0.0, "measured_density": 0.31, "partisan_attack_density": 0.0}, "opinion": {"pronoun_score": 7.5, "subjectivity_score": 25.4, "modal_score": 0.0, "hedging_score": 0.0, "attribution_score": 12.3, "metadata_score": 0.0, "value_judgment_score": 100.0, "absolutist_assertion_score": 0.0, "classification": "Reporting", "dominant_signals": ["value_judgments", "subjectivity", "attribution_gaps"]}, "coverage": {"named_sources_count": 2, "org_ci